	"notice": "Original Circuit, rather than Circuit Tracks or Rhythm. Enable MIDI note and CC transmission in the setup view. Synth macros use factory channels 1 and 2; drums use channel 10. The two macro rows represent the same eight encoders on the two synth tracks. Pad notes are virtual chromatic defaults; use MIDI learn to match the selected scale and octave. If hardware channels have changed, edit the surface mappings.",
